#!/bin/sh
# Install or upgrade the Herdr app mods the main-copy layout uses (their code
# is downloaded, not kept in this repo). Run with the Herdr app open; keys and
# layout edits are already in the repo, and the installers leave them as they are.
set -eu

herdr-app status >/dev/null 2>&1 || { echo "herdr-app-mods: open the Herdr app first" >&2; exit 1; }

tmp=$(mktemp -d)

# launchd can load herdr-app's checker job without starting it, and the
# installers then time out on `herdr-app check`: start any such job by hand
uid=$(id -u)
while :; do
  launchctl list | awk '/dev\.herdr\.check\./ { print $3 }' | while read -r job; do
    launchctl kickstart "gui/$uid/$job" >/dev/null 2>&1 || true
  done
  sleep 0.3
done &
kicker=$!
trap 'kill "$kicker" 2>/dev/null || true; rm -rf "$tmp"' EXIT
trap 'exit 1' HUP INT TERM

curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChmaraX/herdr-nvim/main/install.sh | sh -s -- --app
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChmaraX/herdr-gitview/main/install.sh | sh -s -- --app

# herdr-critters has no release installer: run its repo's own install.sh
git clone -q --depth 1 https://github.com/izerozlu/herdr-critters "$tmp/herdr-critters"
sh "$tmp/herdr-critters/install.sh"

# critters' palettes are fixed: default to the edo look, on the newsprint theme's paper
themes="${HERDR_APP_HOME:-$HOME/.config/herdr-app}/mods/herdr-critters/themes"
sed -i '' 's/DEFAULT_THEME = "retro"/DEFAULT_THEME = "edo"/' "$themes/index.js"
sed -i '' 's/bg: "#efe6d0"/bg: "#e0d9c8"/' "$themes/edo/theme.js"

# edo night: on newsprint-dark's paper, whenever the app's appearance is dark
sed -i '' 's/^export default {/const day = {/' "$themes/edo/theme.js"
cat >>"$themes/edo/theme.js" <<'EOF'

import { settings } from "herdr";

const night = {
  colors: {
    bg: "#26241f",
    head: "#968d7c",
    machine: "#d9695c",
    focus: "#d9695c",
    text: "#d6cebb",
    sub: "#a89f8c",
    badgeBg: "#1f1d19cc",
    idleEdge: "#7d7567",
    idleMark: "#c9c0ad",
    idleBox: "#5a5448",
    btnEdge: "#45403a",
    divider: "#38342c",
    rowHover: "#ffffff0d",
    clear: "#00000000",
    statusEdgeAlpha: "99",
  },
  scenes: {
    fuji: { card: "#2c2f33", edge: "#434c5a", box: "#6f8fb5", label: "#9db6d3" },
    sakura: { card: "#332a2a", edge: "#5a4444", box: "#c87a8a", label: "#dd9aa6" },
    take: { card: "#2c2f26", edge: "#48523a", box: "#7d9a5a", label: "#a6c088" },
    kaki: { card: "#332c23", edge: "#5a4a35", box: "#c87a3a", label: "#dca16c" },
  },
  status: {
    working: { word: "BUSY", color: "#7fa3c9" },
    blocked: { word: "HELP!", color: "#e0584e" },
    done: { word: "DONE", color: "#8fb078" },
    idle: { word: "IDLE", color: "#968d7c" },
  },
};

export default new Proxy(day, { get: (look, key) => (settings().dark && key in night ? night[key] : look[key]) });
EOF
